# Never copy host artifacts into the build context — node_modules is reinstalled
# in-image (host is amd64; the image is arm64) and dist is rebuilt from source.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.svelte-kit
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.vite

.git
.github
.claude
docs
tests/e2e

**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
.editorconfig
.nvmrc
